      "agent_input": "Please read the order details for order ORD-6C71B1 from data/order_summary.xlsx and show me the summary.",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\nskill_info = await load_skill(\"OfficeBench\")\nprint(skill_info)\n\nawait run_command(\"uv pip install openpyxl\")\n\nawait run_command(\"python -c \\\"import openpyxl; print('ok')\\\"\")\n\ncontent = await read_file(\"data/order_summary.xlsx\")\nprint(content[:200])\n\nscript = \"\"\"\nimport openpyxl\n\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook('data/order_summary.xlsx')\nfor sheet_name in wb.sheetnames:\n    ws = wb[sheet_name]\n    print(f\"Sheet: {sheet_name}\")\n    print(f\"Rows: {ws.max_row}, Cols: {ws.max_column}\")\n    # Print header\n    headers = [cell.value for cell in ws[1]]\n    print(f\"Headers: {headers}\")\n    # Find the order ORD-6C71B1\n    for row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2, values_only=False):\n        values = [cell.value for cell in row]\n        if 'ORD-6C71B1' in [str(v) for v in values if v is not None]:\n            print(f\"Found order row: {values}\")\n    print()\n\"\"\"\nawait write_file(\"./read_order.py\", script)\nprint(\"Script written\")\n\nresult = await run_command(\"python ./read_order.py\")\nprint(result)\n\nscript2 = \"\"\"\nimport openpyxl\n\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook('data/order_summary.xlsx')\nfor sheet_name in wb.sheetnames:\n    ws = wb[sheet_name]\n    headers = [cell.value for cell in ws[1]]\n    for row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2, values_only=True):\n        values = list(row)\n        if 'ORD-6C71B1' in [str(v) for v in values if v is not None]:\n            print(f\"=== Order ORD-6C71B1 Details (Sheet: {sheet_name}) ===\")\n            for h, v in zip(headers, values):\n                print(f\"  {h}: {v}\")\n            print()\n\"\"\"\nawait write_file(\"./read_order2.py\", script2)\nprint(\"Script written\")\n\nresult2 = await run_command(\"python ./read_order2.py\")\nprint(result2)\n```",
